# This directory MUST stay empty in core.
#
# Components register INTO the engine by appearing here as their own
# manifest-referenced module; core never reaches OUT to a named component
# (blueprint design-notes-id, decision 8 / Contract B).
#
# The HARD RULE: core must boot, serve a Workbench, and (at M1) run a local CLI
# with src/components/ EMPTY. If core cannot start without something in here,
# the structure is wrong. claude-code will be the FIRST component (decision 3),
# added at a later milestone — as its own module, not a core edit.
